OL,3,GNEWSANo room to hide in force, says
OL,4,Apolice chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chief has vowed to do
OL,7,Feverything in his power to remove "bad
OL,8,Fofficers" following accusations his
OL,9,Fforce failed to investigate serving and
OL,10,Fformer police officers for domestic
OL,11,Fabuse and sexual violence.
OL,13,FDevon and Cornwall Police Chief
OL,14,FConstable James Vaughan admitted the
OL,15,Fforce had racists, misogynists and
OL,16,Fpeople who abused their power but he
OL,17,Fsaid he was working tirelessly to
OL,18,Fidentify and remove them.
OL,20,F"There is zero tolerance here, there is
OL,21,Fno room to hide," he warned.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
