OL,3,GNEWSANo room to hide in force, says
OL,4,Apolice chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the BBC reported nine women had
OL,7,Fbeen paid compensation over police
OL,8,Fabuse claims, a former female officer
OL,9,Falleged she was also sexually assaulted
OL,10,Fby a colleague on a work trip in
OL,11,FEurope.
